@ConferenceBooking.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102
@roomId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@serviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Отримати всі зали (скопіюй id залу і послуг)
GET {{ConferenceBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Accept: application/json

### Знайти вільні зали
GET {{ConferenceBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/available?startTime=2024-09-01T10:00:00&endTime=2024-09-01T14:00:00&minCapacity=50
Accept: application/json

### Забронювати зал (підстав roomId і serviceId з GET /api/rooms)
POST {{ConferenceBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "startTime": "2024-09-01T10:00:00",
  "duration": "04:00:00",
  "selectedServiceIds": ["{{serviceId}}"]
}

### Створити зал
POST {{ConferenceBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Зал D",
  "capacity": 40,
  "baseHourlyRate": 1800,
  "services": [
    { "name": "Проєктор", "price": 500 },
    { "name": "Wi-Fi", "price": 300 }
  ]
}

### Оновити зал (підстав свій ID)
PUT {{ConferenceBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Зал A",
  "capacity": 55,
  "baseHourlyRate": 2500,
  "services": [
    { "name": "Проєктор", "price": 500 },
    { "name": "Wi-Fi", "price": 300 },
    { "name": "Звук", "price": 700 }
  ]
}

### Зведення звітів за день
GET {{ConferenceBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/reports/summary?from=2024-09-01T00:00:00&to=2024-09-02T00:00:00
Accept: application/json

### Завантаженість залів
GET {{ConferenceBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/reports/occupancy?from=2024-09-01T00:00:00&to=2024-09-02T00:00:00
Accept: application/json

### Виручка по залах
GET {{ConferenceBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/reports/revenue?from=2024-09-01T00:00:00&to=2024-09-02T00:00:00
Accept: application/json

### Популярні послуги
GET {{ConferenceBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/reports/services?from=2024-09-01T00:00:00&to=2024-09-02T00:00:00
Accept: application/json
